# A second Claude account in its own status bar slot, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-claudeother-setting-accounts-file = Optional. The same accounts file as [usage.providers.claude] accounts_file, e.g. "~/.cache/claude-accounts.json". The first listed account that is not the active one shows here, in a slot of its own beside Claude's, with its alias as the label.
